// GroundAoe (common/src/comp/ability.rs) has no heal-delivery field --
// `damage`/`poise`/`knockback` (or the pooled-debuff path for a shared-HP
// mechanic like Sleep) are the only per-target outcomes this variant can
// express. The sheet's own hybrid rider ("also heals one chosen ally in the
// area") is dropped, same class of gap as chill_touch.ron's anti-healing
// rider in this same folder -- no existing primitive delivers a
// damage-some/heal-others split within one AoE resolution. Ships as a pure
// necrotic damage zone, shape of bloodboil.ron (hemomancy) scaled to this
// school's own established level-1 single-target damage band
// (ray_of_sickness/chill_touch: 14-16).
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 55.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    delay: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    max_range: 18.0,
    radius: 3.0,
    min_falloff: 0.4,
    damage: 18,
    poise: 8,
    knockback: (strength: 5, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    reagent: None,
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (school: Some(Necromancy), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
